    "intro_narrative": "The notorious hacker known only as 'The Cipher' has successfully infiltrated the police department's highly secure underground server room. All systems were abruptly locked down at midnight, cutting off access to crucial ongoing investigations. As the precinct's lead cyber-detective, you have been urgently called in to investigate the breach before the morning shift arrives. The room is dead silent, save for the rhythmic humming of the cooling units and the blinking lights of the mainframes. The Cipher is known for leaving intricate digital trails and booby-trapped logic puzzles to mock the authorities. Your primary objective tonight is to trace the hacker's steps and locate the hidden digital archive where the stolen, highly sensitive case files have been compressed and stashed. If you fail to find the exact file path by dawn, years of critical police work will be permanently erased or leaked to the criminal underworld. The clock is ticking, and the shadows of the server room seem to close in around you. You must carefully examine every piece of physical and digital evidence left behind, relying entirely on your deductive skills to recover the compromised data.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
